NAME
     kill - send a signal to a process

SYNOPSIS
     kill [-s SIGNAL] PID...
     kill -SIGNAL PID...

DESCRIPTION
     kill sends a signal -- TERM by default -- to each PID. The signal
     may be given by number or by name, with or without the SIG prefix.

OPTIONS
     -s SIGNAL   the signal to send; -l lists the names

SEE ALSO
     pgrep(1), ps(1), signal(7) is not provided
